    learn_delay_t: 'Why are messages late?', learn_delay: 'Mars is very far away. Even radio waves need minutes to get there. Press the button and watch your message fly.',
    learn_plants_t: 'Plants keep you alive', learn_plants: 'Plants need light and water. Then they give you food and fresh air. Try giving them light!',
    learn_suit_t: 'Why wear a space suit?', learn_suit: 'The air on Mars is very thin, and you cannot breathe it. Your suit carries your air, so going outside uses it up.',
